# Challenge 1: suspicious_mshta_execution.yml
title: Malicious mshta 
id: 5d96c634-34f9-4331-a44d-15a6163f50a6 #Universally Unique Identifier (UUID) from https://www.uuidgenerator.net
status: experimental
description: Execution of malicious HTA payload from a phishing link.
